weight.description:
Weight of each voice in the synthesized audio. Must be filled together with `voice_id`. Value range [1, 100]. Supports up to 4 voice mixtures. The higher the proportion of a single voice, the closer the synthesized voice resembles that voice.


```json dark

"timbre_weights": [
  {
    "voice_id": "female-chengshu",
    "weight": 30
  },
  {
    "voice_id": "female-tianmei",
    "weight": 70
  }
]

```
